    "conclusions": "体积$V=\\frac{h}{3}(S_1+S_2+\\sqrt{S_1S_2})$。当$S_1=S_2$时退化为柱体$V=S_1h$；当$S_1=0$时退化为锥体$V=\\frac13 S_2 h$。"
